Tenali Rama and the Empty Pot (Raw Story)

One day, King Krishnadevaraya gave each of his courtiers a pot and some seeds.

He said, “Plant these seeds and bring me the plant after one month. The best plant will win a reward.”

All the courtiers planted their seeds and took care of them.

After a few weeks, beautiful plants began to grow in their pots.

But Tenali Rama’s pot remained empty.

He tried everything, but nothing grew.

After one month, everyone brought their pots to the king.

The courtiers proudly showed their healthy plants.

Tenali came with an empty pot.

The king looked at all the pots carefully.

Then he smiled and said, “Tenali Rama is the winner!”

Everyone was surprised.

The king explained, “I had given boiled seeds. They could not grow. Only Tenali was honest and brought an empty pot.”

Tenali was praised for his truthfulness.

💖 Moral:

Honesty is the best policy.
